erpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"光武","kind":"person","person_id":"6c9_c43_555","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-ws7903772"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p021","text":"帝小乙崩，子帝武丁立。帝武丁即位，思復興殷，而未得其佐。三年不言，政事決定於冢宰，以觀國風。武丁夜夢得聖人，名曰說。以夢所見視群臣百吏，皆非也。於是迺使百工營求之野，得說於傅險中。是時說為胥靡，筑於傅險。見於武丁，武丁曰是也。得而與之語，果聖人，舉以為相，殷國大治。故遂以傅險姓之，號曰傅說。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"帝小乙","kind":"person","person_id":"blo_hqh_iqg","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"帝武丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"帝武丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"冢宰","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"武丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"說","kind":"person","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0084","start":84,"end":85,"surface":"說","kind":"person","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface":"說","kind":"person","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"武丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"武丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"傅說","kind":"person","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","status":"source_identified"}],"annotation_status":"in_progress","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"}],"table_passages":[{"id":"shiji-013-t2-r021-c00","column":0,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"帝武丁。雉升鼎耳雊。得傅說。稱高宗。","source_row":21,"source_column":1,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-013-t2-r021-c00-m000","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"武丁","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉殷王世系與《殷本紀》暫定同指；湯子太丁與武乙子太丁分別辨認。"},{"id":"shiji-013-t2-r021-c00-m001","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"傅說","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉殷王世系與《殷本紀》暫定同指；湯子太丁與武乙子太丁分別辨認。"}],"table_id":"shiji-013","table_fragment_id":"shiji-013-digital-table-2","table_row_id":"shiji-013-t2-r021","table_cell_id":"shiji-013-t2-r021-c00","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-013","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-013","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-013","source_revision":"2606991","source_header":[""],"row_year":null}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-ws2506399-peiwei","source":{"title":"《晉書》卷三十五子頠完整附傳選錄","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷035&oldid=2506399","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=晉書/卷035&oldid=2506399","revision_id":2506399,"accessed_on":"2026-10-24","extent":"子頠附傳完整十五自然段，含晉書收到崇有之論全部引文容器及二子敘述；非裴秀全傳/卷035全卷或獨立原著全文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄，保留來源歸屬；數位文字依CC BY-SA 4.0。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":null,"wikitext_sha256":"b27aa9fc386b5f40990822d615febffcb8b8cd6df3fe6f74585274ff733c12be","raw_file":"sources/witnesses/jin035-ws2506399.wikitex